if(typeof require==='function'){var Constants=require('./constants');var Weapon=require('./weapon');var Mine=require('./mine');var IdGenerator=require('./idgenerator');}var MineWeapon=Weapon.subclass();MineWeapon.fields({_numMines:0,_triggerPulled:false});MineWeapon.classMethods({createInitialWeaponState:function(id,playerId,numMines){var fields={_numMines:numMines,_triggerPulled:false};return Weapon.createInitialWeaponState(id,playerId,Constants.WEAPON_TYPES.MINE,JSON.stringify(fields));}});MineWeapon.methods({fire:function(){if(!this._triggerPulled){this._triggerPulled=true;if(this._numMines>0){--this._numMines;this._emitEvent(Weapon._EVENTS.WEAPON_FIRED,this);return true;}}return false;},getProjectileStates:function(tank){return[];},getTrapStates:function(tank){var trapState=Mine.createInitialTrapState(IdGenerator.instance.gen('mi'),tank.getPlayerId(),tank.getX()+Math.sin(tank.getRotation())*Constants.MINE.OFFSET.m,tank.getY()-Math.cos(tank.getRotation())*Constants.MINE.OFFSET.m,-Math.sin(tank.getRotation())*Constants.MINE.LAUNCH_SPEED.m,Math.cos(tank.getRotation())*Constants.MINE.LAUNCH_SPEED.m);return[trapState];},release:function(){this._triggerPulled=false;},reload:function(projectile){},movementLocked:function(){return false;},update:function(deltaTime){},done:function(){return this._numMines==0&&!this._triggerPulled;},isDefault:function(){return false;}});if(typeof module==='object'){module.exports=MineWeapon;}